# merge-other plus a county bias: where the page uses the county list, each row's bias moves by 0.5 times the log of the
# ratio of its label's share among the Alachua fitting photos to its weighted share among all the fitting photos
# (lambda 0.5 from tools/world/county.py, on tuning photos only; set before this run). TinyCLIP 39M/16.
MODEL=tinyclip-39m-16
HEAD_ARGS="--recipe merge-county"
